udDUwMzc5MDYzNw==","user":{"login":"cphang99","id":17321840,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MzIxODQw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17321840?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cphang99","html_url":"https://github.com/cphang99","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cphang99/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cphang99/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cphang99/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cphang99/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cphang99/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cphang99/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cphang99/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cphang99/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cphang99/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2019-06-20T00:09:35Z","updated_at":"2019-06-20T00:09:35Z","body":"> Hm, can it be because those tags are not properly propagated?\r\n> What rules were you using for those tagged targets?\r\n\r\nWe’re using a custom rule, but we can verify that the `no-remote` and `no-cache` tags are being correctly propagated.\r\n\r\nFor a particular target that produces 2GB artefacts, with `no-remote` and `no-cache` tags set, a bazel build of that target is 10x slower, but *only* when BES + remote execution is enabled. Interestingly, this is not shown in the elapsed time, but only on using a `time` command.\r\n```\r\nINFO: Elapsed time: 4.706s, Critical Path: 0.63s\r\nINFO: 0 processes.\r\n\r\nreal    0m40.333s\r\nuser    0m0.040s\r\nsys     0m0.028s\r\n```","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/comments/503790637/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"cphang99","id":17321840,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MzIxODQw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17321840?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cphang99","html_url":"https://github.com/cphang99","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cphang99/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cphang99/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cphang99/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cphang99/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cphang99/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cphang99/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cphang99/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cphang99/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cphang99/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/comments/505213742","html_url":"https://github.com/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/8673#issuecomment-505213742","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/8673","id":505213742,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDUwNTIxMzc0Mg==","user":{"login":"cphang99","id":17321840,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MzIxODQw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17321840?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cphang99","html_url":"https://github.com/cphang99","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cphang99/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cphang99/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cphang99/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cphang99/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cphang99/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cphang99/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cphang99/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cphang99/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cphang99/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2019-06-24T23:05:38Z","updated_at":"2019-06-24T23:05:38Z","body":"One suggestion:\r\n\r\nWe have observed that enabling `—experimental_remote_download_outputs` i.e. builds without the bytes makes the issue go away in 0.25.3. We have tracked this down to here \r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/bazelbuild/bazel/blob/0.25.3/src/main/java/com/google/devtools/build/lib/remote/RemoteModule.java#L250-L267.\r\n\r\nWe understand that from bazel 0.28, BES will be supported with builds without the bytes (https://github.com/bazelbuild/bazel/pull/8669) but we were wondering whether an additional flag (that would be independent of `--experimental_remote_download_outputs`) that would optionally disable artifact uploads from BES would be useful as well","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/comments/505213742/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"cphang99","id":17321840,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MzIxODQw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17321840?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cphang99","html_url":"https://github.com/cphang99","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cphang99/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cphang99/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cphang99/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cphang99/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cphang99/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cphang99/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cphang99/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/c